---
import Tunnel from '../../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
import Choice from '../../../components/Choice.astro';
---
<Tunnel title="Step 5 - Load on the Player | Save My Gig!" status="Critical · Recovery" red>
  <div class="step-label">Step 5 of 5</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Load music on the player</h2>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>On the CDJ/XDJ, press <span class="mono">SOURCE</span></li>
    <li>Select <span class="mono">USB</span></li>
    <li>Go to <span class="mono">FOLDER</span></li>
    <li>Load tracks from the folder you copied.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="alert-card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    <div style="font-size:20px">⚠️</div>
    <div>These tracks were <strong>not exported via Rekordbox</strong>, so some features may be limited (Quantize, Sync, Hot Cues). This is normal. <strong>You can still play your set.</strong></div>
  </div>

  <p class="question">Can you load and play the tracks on the CDJ?</p>

  <Choice step="load"
    a={{ href: '/saved?path=critical&branch=laptop', label: "YES - I'M PLAYING", event: 'outcome_reached', data: { outcome: 'saved', path: 'critical' } }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/critical/fallback', label: "NO - STILL WON'T READ" }}
  />
</Tunnel>
